# Architecture Design SoT

**Role:** modules, pipelines, contracts, constraints. **Not:** changelog, UX cookbook, flag encyclopedia, milestone tracker.

Ownership: [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Lint: `lintArchitectureDoc`.

## Forbidden

- `\bM\d+\b`, `HOTSPOT-*`, changelog/provenance voice
- UX-only detail / flag laundry lists → `docs/cli-reference.md` / recipes / README

## Allowed

- `ADR-*`, `RT-*`; present-tense product surface; links to CONCERNS, INTEGRATIONS, AGENTS, warning-codes

## Sync

Update or **slim** — do not only append. Milestone-needed prose → ROADMAP/STATE/feature specs.
